# Headers for the built site, read by Workers Static Assets (make dist copies this into
# public/ and adds a rule per hashed style and script, which browsers keep for good).
# Pages, the feed and everything else keep the default: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate,
# with an ETag, so each visit checks for a newer deploy and a 304 answers when there's none.
# Never "cache" in site-worker/wrangler.jsonc: it would bill these requests as the Worker's.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
